  "body": "From https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#valid-source-size-list:\n`A <source-size-value> must not be negative.`, and `Percentages are not allowed in a <source-size-value>, to avoid confusion about what it would be relative to.` are presumably intended as authoring recommendations. What does this mean for the implementor when these are encountered in the wild?\n",
